<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen Expressway debuts at HK$2.65/shr.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen Expressway debuts at HK$2.65/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of expressway developer and operator Shenzhen Expressway Co Ltd made their trading debut at HK$2.65 per share on Wednesday, compared with the issue price of HK$2.20.</p>
</text>
